			"notes": "### New Features:\n- Translation support, with initial translations to Italian and German.\n- Tooltips that explain what most settings do.\n- Option to disable nebulas in custom dimensions that still use Overworld-like rendering.\n- Proper support for the narrator and keyboard navigation in the config screen.\n\n### Fixes:\n- Completely reworked config screen to be much more robust, which fixes unexpected behaviour with apply and done buttons.\n- Crash fixes with the screen narrator."
		},
