			"notes": "Sadly, this version again changes the nebulas compared to the last one because of a breaking change with the generation, but this is for compatibility reasons.\n\n### Changes:\n- Improved Nebula resolution and detail, for a crispier look.\n- Compatibility with Custom Stars when twinkling stars are turned off. #5 \n- Tweaked settings screen for better consistency\n\n### Performance:\n- Simplified Nebula algorithm to be slightly faster.\n- Only generates parts of the sky that are enabled."
